OL,3,GNEWSACable project 'an act of
OL,4,Avandalism' ` campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner has described the
OL,7,Fgovernment's decision to approve a new
OL,8,Fundersea electricity cable project as
OL,9,F"an act of environmental vandalism and
OL,10,Fcommunity vandalism".
OL,12,FThe Sea Link project involves a nearly
OL,13,F90-mile (144km) cable linking the
OL,14,FSuffolk coast between Thorpeness and
OL,15,FAldeburgh with Pegwell Bay in Kent,
OL,16,Fcarrying electricity from offshore
OL,17,Fwindfarms, interconnectors and nuclear
OL,18,Fpower stations
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
