OL,3,GNEWSACable project 'an act of
OL,4,Avandalism' ` campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FFiona Gilmore, from Suffolk Energy
OL,7,FAction Solutions (SEAS), said it would
OL,8,Flead to "years of devastation,
OL,9,Fdisruption, loss of tranquillity, loss
OL,10,Fof the beauty of this landscape, and
OL,11,Floss of our tourism industry".
OL,13,FNational Grid said it took its
OL,14,Fenvironmental responsibilities "very
OL,15,Fseriously".
